Silver Hunter was summoned by [[Dr. Rickman]] at [[Skara Brae]] to hunt down the Huntik team. {{source|Mission to Skara Brae}}

Rickman invoked Silver Hunter in to attack Dante in [[Quimper Cathedral]]. After defeating Dante's [[Solwing]], it fought against [[Caliban]] who was sent back to his Amulet by Rickman's spell. Silver Hunter knocked Dante to the floor but was turned to stone by [[King Basilisk]] before he could finish him off. {{source|The Seekers of Ys}}

Rickman summoned Silver Hunter in the underwater city of Ys, to hunt down Dante, but it was defeated by Dante's [[Metagolem]]. {{source|The Lost City of Casterwill}}
